                "abilities": [
                  {
                    "id": 3486,
                    "name": "Lethal Hits",
                    "rules": "Each time an attack made with a <k>[LETHAL HITS]</k> weapon results in a <b>critical hit</b>, you can choose for that attack to automatically wound the target.\n\n<b>Designer’s Note:</b> <i>Choosing to automatically wound the target means that no <b>wound roll</b> is made for that attack. You may decide against this, as it means that attack cannot result in a <b>critical wound</b> and so cannot trigger other abilities such as <k>[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]</k>.</i>"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": 3367,
                    "name": "Rapid Fire 1",
                    "rules": "This ability always takes the form <k>[RAPID FIRE X]</k>. Each time you gather <b>attack dice</b> for a <k>[RAPID FIRE]</k> weapon, add <b>X</b> additional <b>attack dice</b> if the target unit was within half range of that weapon in the Select Targets step.\n\n<b>Example:</b> If a <k>[RAPID FIRE 1]</k> weapon with an <b>A</b> characteristic of 1 targets a unit that is within half range, you would gather one additional <b>attack dice</b> for that weapon (for a total of two for that weapon)."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
